     7	### Camp 1: `payload.intercept` + No Alpine Changes (Claude Opus, Codex)
     8	
     9	These two argue we've been overthinking it. `payload.intercept` at `request/index.js:407` is **already async and already awaited**, and it fires **before any message processing begins**. Pre-load modules there and the `wire:loading` timing is correct without any new hooks.
